title: 'camtrapReport: Camera-Trap Report Generator'
version: 1.0.44
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.18405441
abstract: Provides an extensible workflow for processing camera-trap data in Camtrap
  DP format and automatically generating reproducible data-status and ecological reports.
  The package supports data-quality checks, ecological summaries, visualisations,
  maps, tables and modular report sections for wildlife-monitoring applications.
